{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（7日）中午12時53分，一名男子在土瓜灣木廠街1B-1C號從高處墮下，倒臥平台受傷。警方稱，事發時九龍城警區刑事調查隊正在上址調查一宗爆竊案</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129062095590002688542397.jpeg/cOELkeuu3mixCLbYK9ViHNl__-a4hOBM0nSBvtJ0gb4\" alt=\"救護員替傷者包紮。（讀者提供）\"><figcaption>救護員替傷者包紮。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129062097813114880604325.jpeg/QVYjJC4OctvdGu8k9xyqSdiXHx8eWHL5DnQ_Kg50Pyo\" alt=\"警員在平台調查。（讀者提供）\"><figcaption>警員在平台調查。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><p>現場消息稱，有人懷疑驚惶失措，由窗口跳過毗鄰簷篷時，跌落約4米下平台受傷。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129056481258246144045731.jpeg/rKXTSPWErfBWHZPRavKtA2qXH672h90OPDik3zw4pN8\" alt=\"據悉，男子爬出窗（打開的窗）跳到毗鄰簷篷時墮下。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>據悉，男子爬出窗（打開的窗）跳到毗鄰簷篷時墮下。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129053962537144320451302.jpeg/0uJE_m5FmDWxWYfbwCwu-MgxoVGkYYHmw2a_zulmv84\" alt=\"消防及救護員在場協助。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>消防及救護員在場協助。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><p>據了解，本周二（5月5日）木廠街發生一宗爆竊案。一名女子報稱單位遭爆竊，損失一批價值數萬元的模型公仔。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129053956765519872762513.jpeg/0AvJqCaIULlHizVKgobG9ayj48Hbj1Ok5q63Ssyut0o\" alt=\"警方在場調查。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>警方在場調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129058445375311872320691.jpeg/jWLXJwbLXe8RNXcfqo1ByZ5Sp9DrDw2NZcsTAGXLEwA\" alt=\"男子由二樓跌落平台受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）\"><figcaption>男子由二樓跌落平台受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129058448277901312815732.jpeg/1Es1PxaqUIw5SXmrGmNZMnnHAPDinNNN94vtePeL7Xg\" alt=\"男子爬出窗，其間由二樓跌落平台受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）\"><figcaption>男子爬出窗，其間由二樓跌落平台受傷。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129058451155324928357910.jpeg/wrhXFxcxZ8Wv9AV6AfTUZ8R4RU4pFRtcW2ZyjFtmcow\" alt=\"警方封鎖現場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\"><figcaption>警方封鎖現場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129052493662130176459387.jpeg/tUhgCd_2Wjsy5n7iSWDWaFDDvv94xse7cqR_LnKkfy4\" alt=\"傷者送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救。（資料圖片）\"><figcaption>傷者送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-07T06:25:53.346500+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":9,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}